<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Web Development Training</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #172033;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding: 20px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2563eb;
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #374151;
      margin-left: 25px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #2563eb;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 90px 7%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero small {
      color: #2563eb;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 55px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 15px 0 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 650px;
    }

    .hero-button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero-button:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .hero-box {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 35px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    .hero-box h2 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero-box div {
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #374151;
    }

    .hero-box div:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    /* Courses */
    .courses {
      background: white;
      padding: 80px 7%;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #667085;
    }

    .course-grid {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .course {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 28px;
      transition: 0.25s;
    }

    .course:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border-color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .number {
      width: 45px;
      height: 45px;
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: #2563eb;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .course h3 {
      font-size: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .course p {
      color: #667085;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 75px;
    }

    .course a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .course a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px;
      background: #111827;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      .course-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      nav a {
        margin-left: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">WebDev Training</div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">

    <div>
      <small>6-DAY WEB DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM</small>

      <h1>
        Learn Web Development<br>
        By Building Projects.
      </h1>

      <p>
        A complete practical training program covering HTML, CSS,
        JavaScript, DOM, AJAX, UI development and real-world projects.
      </p>

      <a href="#courses" class="hero-button">
        Explore Training →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-box">
      <h2>What You'll Learn</h2>

      <div>01 — Networking & Architecture</div>
      <div>02 — HTML5 & CSS3</div>
      <div>03 — JavaScript & DOM</div>
      <div>04 — JavaScript Advanced</div>
      <div>05 — Restaurant Website</div>
      <div>06 — Portfolio & Capstone</div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="courses" id="courses">

    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Training Modules</h2>
      <p>Choose a day and start learning.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="course-grid">

      <div class="course">
        <div class="number">01</div>
        <h3>Networking & Architecture</h3>
        <p>
          Learn client-server architecture, HTTP, HTTPS and
          request-response communication.
        </p>
        <a href="./Day-1/">Open Day 1 →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <div class="number">02</div>
        <h3>HTML5 & CSS3</h3>
        <p>
          Learn modern HTML5, CSS3 and responsive web design
          through practical exercises.
        </p>
        <a href="./Day-2/">Open Day 2 →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <div class="number">03</div>
        <h3>JavaScript & DOM</h3>
        <p>
          Practice JavaScript arrays, functions, DOM manipulation
          and interactive applications.
        </p>
        <a href="./Day-3/">Open Day 3 →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <div class="number">04</div>
        <h3>JavaScript Advanced</h3>
        <p>
          Explore OOP, jQuery, AJAX, UI concepts and
          interactive JavaScript applications.
        </p>
        <a href="./Day-4/">Open Day 4 →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <div class="number">05</div>
        <h3>Restaurant Website</h3>
        <p>
          Build and explore the L'AURA Artisan Kitchen &
          Bistro website project.
        </p>
        <a href="./Day-5/">Open Day 5 →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="course">
        <div class="number">06</div>
        <h3>Portfolio & Capstone</h3>
        <p>
          Complete the training with a portfolio project and
          final course documentation.
        </p>
        <a href="./Day-6/">Open Day 6 →</a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Web Development Training
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
